{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Warlocks Maze",
    "steam_appid": 3470690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/3fdd32eea7184cbd55549694bba7e2c9.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a band of fearless adventurers from a roster of hardened warriors and cunning specialists. Each unit brings unique strengths, but only a well-balanced party will survive the Warlock's minions and deadly traps. Choose wisely\u2014the fate of the Talelands depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/094828defdbc20d04f4da3047a69c403.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the Warlock\u2019s shifting labyrinth, where every corner hides deadly surprises and valuable treasures. No two runs are the same\u2014procedural generation ensures infinite possibilities, from twisted corridors to sprawling caverns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/2b0615e4d1deaca03c502a7f7bf9e6db.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your party to match your strategy. Equip your warriors with powerful gear, discover how to best employ them for battle, and recruit specialists to adapt to the maze\u2019s escalating challenges. The Warlock doesn\u2019t play fair\u2014neither should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/b193cfd61c8850f54ec6c1d6bc711bfe.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly adversaries in brutal turn-based battles. Outsmart ruthless foes with strategic positioning, superior tactics, and bold gambits. Victory isn\u2019t guaranteed, but neither is defeat\u2014be the architect of your triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/7d8107016a290d62099c406384767c3e.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill against others in competitive multiplayer games. Can you outlast your rivals in a race to defeat the Warlock, or will you crush them in direct skirmishes? Fortune favors the bold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/d98670ce8f07e325728613c91f8bf582.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warlock\u2019s Maze remembers your deeds. Amass achievements, unlock powerful relics, and leave your mark in the Hall of Heroes\u2014or in the ruins of failure. Will you become a hero of legend, or just another forgotten soul?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/3fdd32eea7184cbd55549694bba7e2c9.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a band of fearless adventurers from a roster of hardened warriors and cunning specialists. Each unit brings unique strengths, but only a well-balanced party will survive the Warlock's minions and deadly traps. Choose wisely\u2014the fate of the Talelands depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/094828defdbc20d04f4da3047a69c403.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the Warlock\u2019s shifting labyrinth, where every corner hides deadly surprises and valuable treasures. No two runs are the same\u2014procedural generation ensures infinite possibilities, from twisted corridors to sprawling caverns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/2b0615e4d1deaca03c502a7f7bf9e6db.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your party to match your strategy. Equip your warriors with powerful gear, discover how to best employ them for battle, and recruit specialists to adapt to the maze\u2019s escalating challenges. The Warlock doesn\u2019t play fair\u2014neither should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/b193cfd61c8850f54ec6c1d6bc711bfe.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly adversaries in brutal turn-based battles. Outsmart ruthless foes with strategic positioning, superior tactics, and bold gambits. Victory isn\u2019t guaranteed, but neither is defeat\u2014be the architect of your triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/7d8107016a290d62099c406384767c3e.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill against others in competitive multiplayer games. Can you outlast your rivals in a race to defeat the Warlock, or will you crush them in direct skirmishes? Fortune favors the bold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470690/extras/d98670ce8f07e325728613c91f8bf582.webp?t=1744458893\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warlock\u2019s Maze remembers your deeds. Amass achievements, unlock powerful relics, and leave your mark in the Hall of Heroes\u2014or in the ruins of failure. Will you become a hero of legend, or just another forgotten soul?</p>",
    "short_description": "A Warlock has unleashed chaos upon the World of Eld! Lead a band of heroes into his shifting labyrinth in this brutal turn-based dungeon crawler. Outsmart deadly foes, conquer traps, and adapt to ever-changing challenges. Will you emerge victorious or be lost to the maze forever?",
